<p class='note'>Adds or subtracts a few degrees from the temperature measured by the sensor, for the Status page and Home Assistant. Compare with a thermometer in the fridge and freezer and enter the difference.</p>
<div class='cards' style='grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr'>
 <div class='card'><span>Fridge temperature (sensor) now</span><b id='cAir'>-</b></div>
 <div class='card'><span>Freezer temperature (sensor) now</span><b id='cFzv'>-</b></div>
</div>
<div class='row' style='margin-top:14px'>
 <label>Fridge adjustment (&deg;C)<input type='number' id='oF' step='0.1' min='-5' max='5'></label>
