 <label>Show &quot;Full&quot; after it has been full for (minutes)<input type='number' id='iFs' step='0.5' min='0' max='30'></label>
 <button onclick='saveIce()'>Save</button>
</div>
<p class='note'>The ice maker checks the ice level now and then, and the fridge reports &quot;full&quot; for up to about 3 minutes during each check. The stabilised ice bucket only shows Full once it has stayed full this long. 0 = show it straight away.</p>
